### Instructions to run the MATLAB script for quantifying Morphological Computation

1. Download one of the .ZIP files from this repository.
2. Open MATLAB desktop or ONLINE (I used ONLINE version)
3. Import the downloaded .zip file to your MATLAB (Drive folder, in the Online version)
4. Extract the zip file inside your MATLAB directory.
5. Open the extracted folder.
6. Run the ".m" file, which is the main script that computes the MC quantification and plots the results.
